Cave bundles an unmodified build of the proxy core published by MetaCubeX
(https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo), release v1.19.34, licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

Corresponding source: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/tree/v1.19.34
Release binaries:     https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/releases/tag/v1.19.34

The binary is shipped as "cave-core" and runs as a separate process; Cave talks
to it only through command-line arguments and its local HTTP controller.
